{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":20.88},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.96,"end":37.28},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.92,"end":50.48}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.44,"text":"色彩能表達活動氣氛。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.8,"end":6.72,"text":"這裡的色相改變裝飾線與網格區塊，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.96,"end":9.52,"text":"標題和日期顏色保持固定。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.16,"end":12.32,"text":"它應強化原有閱讀順序，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.56,"end":15.2,"text":"而不是製造許多競爭焦點。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.84,"end":20.88,"text":"換色相不能修復擁擠間距或薄弱的字級對比。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.96,"end":22.72,"text":"保留排版，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.12,"end":24.48,"text":"比較兩個色相。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.28,"end":29.36,"text":"檢查白色區塊編號在各背景上的清晰度，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.92,"end":32.72,"text":"保留最能支持標題層級的配色。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":34.2,"end":37.28,"text":"只改色相能修復混亂的閱讀順序嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.92,"end":42.24,"text":"只改色相能修復混亂的閱讀順序嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.6,"end":47.44,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":47.92,"end":50.48,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}